- split/diagnosis cue in the composite's own clause suppresses unless contrast marker follows
- rejected-hypothesis cue suppresses unless contrast marker follows
- mention object immediately before composite (bare/literal/quoted/token/pattern/regex/phrase/expression/string/label [+1 word], or mention|discussion|occurrence|instance|use OF the) suppresses
